=== Theorem 9.17

Let $a in U_n$. Then $a in Q_n$ iff
+ $a in Q_p$ for each odd prime dividing $n$, and
+ $a equiv 1 mod 4$ if $2^2||n$, and $a equiv 1 mod 8$ if $2^3|n$.

==== Pf.

By Lemma 9.12, $a in Q_n$ iff $a in Q_p$ for each prime power $p^e$ in the factorization of $n$.
For odd prime, this is equivalent to $a in Q_p$ by Lemma 9.14.
For $p=2$, it is equivalent to condition (2) by Lemma 9.15.
